window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c394-51b6a84d697f475b.json"]={sha256:"51b6a84d697f475b03c8db74b51cbdea08241fb447f84785d38764d3b3b757a7",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-553f6d117b6ee67e","url":"https://standards.nasa.gov/standard/NASA/NASA-STD-7002","title":"NASA-STD-7002 Payload Test Requirements","titleEn":"NASA-STD-7002 Payload Test Requirements","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c394","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c394","related":[{"id":"c395","referenceUrls":["https://s3vi.ndc.nasa.gov/ssri-kb/topics/21/"],"title":"太空級電子抗輻射概念","titleEn":"Space-electronics radiation tolerance concepts","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：本課總 RMS 上限 1.5 g，倍增案例超限；相同總 RMS 仍不能證明不同頻譜等效。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: At a teaching total limit of 1.5 g, doubling fails; equal total RMS does not establish equivalent spectra. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以卜瓦松模型估計期間內無未修正錯誤機率，區分錯誤修正與抗輻射認證。","differenceEn":"Estimate the probability of no uncorrected errors with a Poisson model, distinguishing error correction from radiation qualification.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成 PSD：20–100 Hz 為 0.01 g²/Hz，100–200 Hz 為 0.005 g²/Hz。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：aRMS=sqrt(0.01×80+0.005×100)。 結果約 1.14018 g RMS。分段常數 PSD 下 aRMS=sqrt(ΣGiΔfi)；Gi 單位 g²/Hz，不能把 RMS 值直接相加。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學未修正錯誤率 0.02 次/日，觀察 30 日。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：P0=exp(−0.02×30)。 結果約 0.548812 fraction。固定獨立事件率 λ 下 P0=e^(−λt)；突發事件和共因效應違反此近似。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic PSD is 0.01 g²/Hz from 20–100 Hz and 0.005 g²/Hz from 100–200 Hz. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: aRMS=sqrt(0.01×80+0.005×100). Result ≈ 1.14018 g RMS. For piecewise-constant PSD, aRMS=sqrt(ΣGiΔfi); Gi is in g²/Hz and RMS values cannot simply be added.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching uncorrected-event rate is 0.02 per day over 30 days. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: P0=exp(−0.02×30). Result ≈ 0.548812 fraction. For constant independent rate λ, P0=e^(−λt); bursts and common-cause effects violate the approximation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c304","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/tiros/"],"title":"TIROS 氣象衛星計畫","titleEn":"TIROS weather-satellite program","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：本課總 RMS 上限 1.5 g，倍增案例超限；相同總 RMS 仍不能證明不同頻譜等效。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: At a teaching total limit of 1.5 g, doubling fails; equal total RMS does not establish equivalent spectra. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"量化雲圖取樣與地面移動造成的像元拖影，規劃可辨識雲界的教學影像。","differenceEn":"Quantify sampling and motion smear to plan an image that resolves a cloud boundary.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成 PSD：20–100 Hz 為 0.01 g²/Hz，100–200 Hz 為 0.005 g²/Hz。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：aRMS=sqrt(0.01×80+0.005×100)。 結果約 1.14018 g RMS。分段常數 PSD 下 aRMS=sqrt(ΣGiΔfi)；Gi 單位 g²/Hz，不能把 RMS 值直接相加。","將地面移動距離除以 GSD，分別保留公尺與像元的中間結果。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic PSD is 0.01 g²/Hz from 20–100 Hz and 0.005 g²/Hz from 100–200 Hz. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: aRMS=sqrt(0.01×80+0.005×100). Result ≈ 1.14018 g RMS. For piecewise-constant PSD, aRMS=sqrt(ΣGiΔfi); Gi is in g²/Hz and RMS values cannot simply be added.","Divide ground displacement by GSD, retaining intermediate results in metres and pixels.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-89ff85de9bb6d7a4","url":"https://s3vi.ndc.nasa.gov/ssri-kb/topics/21/","title":"NASA SSRI Radiation Analysis","titleEn":"NASA SSRI Radiation Analysis","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-52d855447ec28077","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/tiros/","title":"TIROS weather-satellite program — official mission background","titleEn":"TIROS weather-satellite program — official mission background","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
